; Stage 15 W4c (design/stage15-stress-test/diagnostics.md §W4c).
; The imbalance is in the file's LAST top-level form, so no line ever opens a
; new form in column 0 while a form is still open -- there is no second location
; to report. The diagnostic must say the file simply ends unterminated and must
; NOT invent a second number.
(defn other ():i32 (return 0))
(defn main ():i32
  (let (a:i32 1)
    (let (b:i32 2)
      (return (+ a b))
